### ============================================================
### E-Learning Multipaís — Admin Module
### Gestión de Países y Roles
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001/api
@contentType = application/json

### Tokens — obtén estos haciendo login con cada rol
@superAdminToken = PEGA_TOKEN_SUPER_ADMIN
@adminToken      = PEGA_TOKEN_ADMIN
@studentToken    = PEGA_TOKEN_STUDENT

### IDs de prueba
@countryId  = 1
@newCountryId = 1
@userId     = PEGA_GUID_DE_USUARIO


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. PAÍSES
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Listar todos los países — Admin o Super Admin (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 1b. Listar países — como Admin (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 1c. Listar países — sin token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries

###

### 1d. Listar países — como Student (403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###

### 1e. Obtener país por Id (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries/{{countryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 1f. Obtener país inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 1g. Crear país — Super Admin (201 Created)
### Guarda el id del response en @newCountryId
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "PER",
  "name": "Perú"
}

###

### 1h. Error — código duplicado (409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "PER",
  "name": "Perú Duplicado"
}

###

### 1i. Error — código inválido, no 3 letras (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "PE",
  "name": "Perú"
}

###

### 1j. Error — crear país como Admin (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "ECU",
  "name": "Ecuador"
}

###

### 1k. Toggle status — desactivar país (204 No Content)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries/{{countryId}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 1l. Toggle status — activar país (vuelve a ejecutar el mismo)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries/{{countryId}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 1m. Error — toggle como Admin (403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/countries/{{countryId}}/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. USUARIOS
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2a. Listar todos los usuarios — Super Admin sin filtros (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2b. Super Admin — filtrar por país
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?countryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2c. Super Admin — filtrar por rol
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=student
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2d. Super Admin — búsqueda por nombre o email
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?search=juan
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2e. Super Admin — solo verificados
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?isEmailVerified=true
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2f. Super Admin — filtros combinados con paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?countryId=1&role=student&isEmailVerified=true&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2g. Admin — lista usuarios (forzado a su propio país aunque mande countryId=9999)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?countryId=9999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### 2h. Obtener usuario por Id (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###

### 2i. Obtener usuario inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. CAMBIO DE ROL
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3a. Super Admin — asignar rol Admin (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 3b. Super Admin — asignar rol Instructor
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "instructor"
}

###

### 3c. Admin — asignar Student (permitido)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "student"
}

###

### 3d. Error — Admin intenta asignar Admin (403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "admin"
}

###

### 3e. Error — Admin intenta asignar Super Admin (403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "super_admin"
}

###

### 3f. Error — rol inválido (400 Bad Request)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "jefe_supremo"
}

###

### 3g. Error — usuario ya tiene ese rol (409 Conflict)
### Ejecuta 3c dos veces para provocar este error
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "role": "student"
}

###


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. CAMBIO DE PAÍS — solo Super Admin
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4a. Super Admin — cambiar país de usuario (204 No Content)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/country
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryId": 2
}

###

### 4b. Error — Admin intenta cambiar país (403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/country
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryId": 2
}

###

### 4c. Error — país inexistente (404 Not Found)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/country
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryId": 9999
}

###

### 4d. Error — país desactivado (409 Conflict)
### Desactiva primero un país con 1k, luego prueba asignarlo
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/country
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryId": {{countryId}}
}

###

### 4e. Error — usuario ya pertenece a ese país (409 Conflict)
### Ejecuta 4a dos veces con el mismo countryId
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/country
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "countryId": 2
}

###
